00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.617
And I'm really excited, today,
to come talk about App Engine.

00:00:25.617 --> 00:00:27.450
We've got a lot of good
stuff going on here.

00:00:27.450 --> 00:00:29.340
We're going to be going
