00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.640
a lot of things have happened.

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.580
The cloud has changed.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:42.686
Technology has changed.

00:00:42.686 --> 00:00:44.060
