00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.076
how App Engine has kind
of changed with the times

00:00:52.076 --> 00:00:53.700
to make it a great
platform for helping

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.240
build your applications.

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:57.420
So let's have a
