00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.776
Before we get into fun, a
little bit about myself.

00:00:59.776 --> 00:01:00.900
My name is Justin Beckwith.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:02.999
I'm a product manager
at Google primarily,

00:01:02.999 --> 00:01:04.790
